{
  "annotations": [
    {
      "elementId": "tables/2/cells/0",
      "quote": "The catalogue Type - Area - Competency",
      "type": "data-entity",
      "category": null
    },
    {
      "elementId": "tables/2/cells/1",
      "quote": "Read-only to this app - it is maintained elsewhere and loaded in.",
      "type": "integration",
      "category": null
    },
    {
      "elementId": "tables/2/cells/2",
      "quote": "The person",
      "type": "data-entity",
      "category": null
    },
    {
      "elementId": "tables/2/cells/3",
      "quote": "A directory identity, keyed on their Entra object id, created the first time they sign in.",
      "type": "data-requirement",
      "category": null
    },
    {
      "elementId": "tables/2/cells/3",
      "quote": "it has to survive them clearing every level they hold",
      "type": "data-requirement",
      "category": null
    },
    {
      "elementId": "tables/2/cells/5",
      "quote": "One person, one competency, one level: Learner, Advanced or Expert.",
      "type": "data-requirement",
      "category": null
    },
    {
      "elementId": "tables/2/cells/5",
      "quote": "we keep it until twelve months after the person's account is disabled, and it never goes into logs.",
      "type": "data-requirement",
      "category": null
    },
    {
      "elementId": "paragraphs/156",
      "quote": "The catalogue keeps being maintained outside this app.",
      "type": "assumption",
      "category": null
    },
    {
      "elementId": "paragraphs/157",
      "quote": "Everyone who needs the app already has a corporate Entra ID account.",
      "type": "assumption",
      "category": null
    },
    {
      "elementId": "paragraphs/158",
      "quote": "Before launch we need an export of the current catalogue and everyone's existing assessments out of Power Apps, from whoever owns that app.",
      "type": "dependency",
      "category": null
    },
    {
      "elementId": "paragraphs/159",
      "quote": "At the start of the build we need an Entra ID app registration per environment, with redirect URIs and credentials, from the corporate identity team.",
      "type": "dependency",
      "category": null
    },
    {
      "elementId": "paragraphs/161",
      "quote": "Telling people a write failed is our idea, not yours.",
      "type": "assumption",
      "category": null
    },
    {
      "elementId": "paragraphs/161",
      "quote": "Nobody asked for it, but with the Save button gone a failed write is otherwise invisible and the person walks away believing a false claim was recorded.",
      "type": "functional-requirement",
      "category": null
    },
    {
      "elementId": "paragraphs/162",
      "quote": "Should unrated and \"I have looked at this and it does not apply to me\" be the same thing?",
      "type": "assumption",
      "category": null
    },
    {
      "elementId": "paragraphs/162",
      "quote": "Today they are - a blank row means both.",
      "type": "assumption",
      "category": null
    },
    {
      "elementId": "paragraphs/162",
      "quote": "if staffing ever wants to distinguish \"nobody has assessed this\" from \"nobody here can do this\", the model needs a fourth state and we should know now rather than after migration.",
      "type": "functional-requirement",
      "category": null
    }
  ],
